<section class="sec" id="story">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow"><b>01</b> Our story</span>
        <h2 class="display">The science of you.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="sec-head__lede">
        Stop guessing with your skin. We combine daily photos with label reading to show
        what suits you — and the reason behind every suggestion.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="story-cols">
      <article class="panel reveal">
        <span class="panel__num">A</span>
        <h3 class="h3">Your portable clinic</h3>
        <p>
          One photo in daylight is enough to start. We check the light, the framing and how
          much skin we can see before we read anything — and we ask for another photo
          instead of guessing.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="panel reveal">
        <span class="panel__num">B</span>
        <h3 class="h3">Scan, learn, refine</h3>
        <p>
          Your readings settle into a profile you can correct. If we got your skin wrong,
          you tell us, and it changes. Every recommendation carries the ingredient that
          caused it.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
